{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-22", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - ascetic_zip", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/7a65e0158527d180a372d84552f6d8f605a559f362449e2d97e5a6e7242cb589.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 ascetic_zip 문제</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/55c8d1e220221dd0a2a7d54328b2411b0c328c8ac6bcb1c177fde01a312cc7fe.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>다운로드받은 파일의 flag.jpg</p>\n<p>사진을 열어보면 2개의 사진이 충돌한 것처럼 깨진것을 알 수 있음</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/67553202c42518e89f82e4fe78fb0b6c8d0606bd01857b8b5bfd01387f5bf272.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>사진을HxD로 연 뒤 PK (zip) 시그니처 검색</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/c32d6b260b904acc3a6c06cfed1571782786ef3367a7f87e75486398bc82abb4.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>검색 결과 밑에 바로 flag.txt도 발견</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/4eedf8fd1a2e6010be557ba90756f4bae95efd9b0b5d689c099346dd8e046685.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>이 PK의 시작점부터 끝까지 선택 후 새로운 zip 파일로 저장</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/ffb55674453772a98455f6ccee7ef97e51904f0a0c5d79c7a4289ae0a8ecda1a.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/7afccced49a2daf5cf33e34d6e39e1a678125c3458366bd592423eef66f50e34.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>zip 파일을 열어보니 flag.txt 파일이 나왔고 파일을 열어보려하니 비밀번호 필요</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>비밀번호가 뭔지 전혀 몰라서 웬만한 비밀번호 <s>(1234라던가 1q2e3r4r 등등)</s>를 넣어보다가 문제 이름인 ascetic을 넣어봤더니 비밀번호가 풀림..</p>\n<p>flag찾기 완료</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/8ec53dede0ce062ae59cbc5e3f5935de1036d3ec2321537db6ad91c135911998.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/3c7b38a479d8d59ec8caaf0fa726cb32d3ec12c9160cb5125ff8d466a3baa877.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>", "assets": ["3c7b38a479d8d59ec8caaf0fa726cb32d3ec12c9160cb5125ff8d466a3baa877.png", "4eedf8fd1a2e6010be557ba90756f4bae95efd9b0b5d689c099346dd8e046685.png", "55c8d1e220221dd0a2a7d54328b2411b0c328c8ac6bcb1c177fde01a312cc7fe.png", "67553202c42518e89f82e4fe78fb0b6c8d0606bd01857b8b5bfd01387f5bf272.png", "7a65e0158527d180a372d84552f6d8f605a559f362449e2d97e5a6e7242cb589.png", "7afccced49a2daf5cf33e34d6e39e1a678125c3458366bd592423eef66f50e34.png", "8ec53dede0ce062ae59cbc5e3f5935de1036d3ec2321537db6ad91c135911998.png", "c32d6b260b904acc3a6c06cfed1571782786ef3367a7f87e75486398bc82abb4.png", "ffb55674453772a98455f6ccee7ef97e51904f0a0c5d79c7a4289ae0a8ecda1a.png"]}